### Run immediately
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_type": "print",
  "payload": {
    "msg": "hello"
  }
}

### Schedule in the future (SG time)
POST http://localhost:8080/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "run_at": "2026-03-01T00:10:00+08:00",
  "job_type": "sleep",
  "payload": {
    "seconds": 2
  }
}